(255, 228, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 14pt;\">개관(2026. 8. 29.)이후 매주 월요일 시행하는 추가선발</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">에</span></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(102, 232, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">생활관 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(102, 232, 255); font-size: 14pt;\">우선/일반/개관 전 추가선발에 신청하실 경우, 탈락처리됩니다.</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(102, 232, 255); font-size: 14pt;\">특히 추가선발은 학기 당 1회 신청가능하므로&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"background-color: rgb(102, 232, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\">꼭 개관 이후 추가선발에 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(102, 232, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\">자세한 사항은 생활관 홈페이지 내 선발 공고문을 참고하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8;\">  </p><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; border-style: double; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(243, 197, 52); background-color: rgb(254, 254, 184); line-height: 1.8;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">FAQ</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">  &nbsp;  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1. 1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학기 또는 하계방학에 거주하던 호실이 달라지나요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">     </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">☞ 네,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">호실을 재배정합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  2</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. 1학기 또는 </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">하계방학에 거주하던 호실과 동일한 호실을 사전신청하였습니다. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">     퇴실 일에 퇴실하지 않고 짐을 그대로 두어도 되나요?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">     </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">☞ 아니오, 퇴사기한~입사가능일시 사이 호실 내 점검 및 청소가 이루어지므로</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">        모든 학생들은 짐 정리 및 청소 후 퇴실하시어 호실 내 개인 짐을 방치할 수 없습니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">        ※ 벌점 기준표</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">           &lt;나&gt;유형 11. 청소와 정리정돈이 불량하거나 퇴사시 관생실 청소를 하지 않거나 개인 짐을 방치한 행위(4~7)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">  &nbsp;  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  3</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">공고문에 나온 신청 기간 말고는 신청을 못하나요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">     </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">☞ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">네</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">신청기간 외에는 신청이 불가합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">  &nbsp;  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> 4</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">선발 결과는 언제 확인할 수 있나요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">     </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">☞ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">신청하신 선발의 등록기간에 확인 가능합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">         </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">예</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">우선선발</span><font face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"> </font><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">신청 결과 </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">→ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">우선선발 등록기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(7.13.~7.14. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">매일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">10:00 ~ 16:00)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">에 확인 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">  &nbsp;  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> 5</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">우선선발</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">일반선발</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">추가선발 중 저는 어느 관에 신청할 수 있나요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">     </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">☞ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">공고문의 마지막 페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(16p)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">에서 대상에 따라 우선</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">일반선발에 신청가능 관을 확인하실 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;        <span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">추가선발때는 모든 관에 신청 가능합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">자세한 사항은 첨부파일의 공고문 8페이지를 확인하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">  &nbsp;  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> 6</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">담당자 전화번호가 어떻게 되나요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">     </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">☞ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">선발 문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 054-478-7943</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">     </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">☞ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">생활관비 문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: (</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">푸름관비)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"> 7201, (</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">오름관비) </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">7947, (</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">오름관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2·3</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">동 공공요금 예치금) </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">7947</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">     </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">☞ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">푸름관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">아름관 시설</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">공사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">고장 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 7944</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">     </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">☞ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">오름관 시설</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">공사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">고장 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">각 관 운영사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">오름관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">동</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(070-8786-5001), </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">오름관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2·3</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">동</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(054-462-3032)</span></p></div><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8;\"><br></p><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border-style: double; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(193, 193, 193); background-color: rgb(238, 238, 238);\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 11.6pt; text-indent: -11.6pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 12pt;\">생활관 운영은 변경될 수 있으며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 12pt;\">배정된 관 및 호실 등이 변경될 수 있음을 생활관 신청 전 반드시 숙지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">오름관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">동 원룸형</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 12pt;\">납부인원이 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">배정인원의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">30%</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">이하</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 12pt;\">일 경우 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">미운영 예정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">선발일정 외 생활관 신청 불가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 12.9pt; padding: 0px; text-indent: -12.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">대학원생</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">은 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">추가선발 신청기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">내 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">오름관 일반형 지원 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 12.9pt; padding: 0px; text-indent: -12.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">생활관 시설 상세 사이즈</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">는 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">생활관 홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">생활관안내</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">를 반드시 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">참고</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">-</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">납부기간 내 생활관비 미납 시 별도 통보 없이 자동 탈락 처리</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">예외 처리 불가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 12.3pt; padding: 0px; text-indent: -12.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">결핵진단서 미제출자 입사 불가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">(2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">학년도</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">결핵진단서 기제출자</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">는 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">제출 필요 없음</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 12.1pt; padding: 0px; text-indent: -12.1pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">푸름관 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">3·4</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">동 공유형</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">(1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">인실</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">은 호실 내 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">소음</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">에 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">취약</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">함을 사전에 안내드리오니 생활관 신청 시 참고하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 12.1pt; padding: 0px; text-indent: -12.1pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">글로벌 생활관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">(BTL) </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">착공</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">으로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">~ 12</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">월 소음 발생 예상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">,</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">협조와 양해 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 15.4pt; padding: 0px; line-height: 18.2px; text-indent: -15.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">호실 내 집합금지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">본인 호실에 본인 및 룸메이트 외 출입금지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">위반시 벌점부과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 15.4pt; padding: 0px; text-indent: -15.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">   </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">벌점 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">점 초과 시 </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">퇴사 조치</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">되며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">예외불가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 12.9pt; padding: 0px; text-indent: -12.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">해충방역 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">정기방역 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">월 실시 예정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8;\"></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"22603\"></div><p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 12.9pt; padding: 0px; text-indent: -12.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">짐 옮길 때 사용하는 대차의 대여가능 수량이 적으므로 개인 준비 필요</span></p></div><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8;\"><br></p><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border-style: double; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(243, 197, 52); background-color: rgb(254, 254, 184);\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 11.5pt; text-indent: -11.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">구미 소재 대학교 재학 중인 학생은 구미 첫 전입신고 시 청년월세 지원 문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">구미시청 인구청년과 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">054-480-2501, 2503)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 11.6pt; padding: 0px; text-indent: -11.6pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">생활관비 납부자 대상 구미시 전입 확약서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">또는 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">전입 불가 사유서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">작성 의무화</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 11.6pt; padding: 0px; line-height: 18.2px; text-indent: -11.6pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">전입 확약서 작성자</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">는 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">추후 전입 확인 필수</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-size: 16px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8;\"></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"17432\"></div><p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 27.3pt; padding: 0px; line-height: 18.2px; text-indent: -27.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold;\">전입 확약서 제출자 대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">개관일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">(2026.8.29.)</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">로부터 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">일 이내 추후 안내 예정인 구미시로 주소이전이 확인되지 않은 관생의 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">, </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 27.3pt; padding: 0px; line-height: 18.2px; text-indent: -27.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">             벌점기준표 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">&gt;</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">유형 </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">⑮</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">항목 위반으로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">점 벌점 부과 예정</span></p></div><p class=\"0\" style